node_modules/
dist/
*.log
settings.json
.env

# Benchmarks and notes stay local, in full — nothing under these ships with
# the app. They also happen to be the heavy, redistribution-unfriendly parts:
# bench/images/ is ~11MB of generated output, bench-papers/ holds ~450MB of
# published-paper PDFs plus verbatim transcriptions of them.
# Note that CLAUDE.md / PROGRESS.md / README.md link into these folders, so
# those links only resolve in a working copy that has them.
bench*/
docs/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
